      "role": "user",
      "content": "that seems like a pretty strong conclusion to draw. if i'm writing this paper, shouldn't i be looking at the arguments for why it might have been beneficial? like, isn't it a bit unfair to just call it a \"clear net negative\" without really exploring the potential upsides for the economy as a whole?",
